            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at El Peck",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nUnmissable! A veritable temple of Italian Cuisine in Da Nang\nApr 2021\nWhen in Da Nang, we make the pilgrimage to El Peck to bask in the greatness of Chef Alessio Rasom, a chef that started his career in the humble surroundings of Northern Italy and has since travelled the world, working in highly sought-after eateries; Kinobu in Osaka, a variety of restaurants in France including Ze Kitchen Galerie and Latin America.\n\nEl Peck is about the catch of the day and on a normal morning you’ll see Chef at the fisherman’s market seeking the freshest, locally caught produce in town.\n\nHis dedication to creating excellent cuisine is palpable and for this reason, we salute him.\n\nLooking forward to my next trip to Da Nang to enjoy the cuisine once again. Skip the rest, I would rate this as the best Italian restaurant in Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 21, 2021",
